@startuml
title CON-SD-D10 Manual Release Governance Flow
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Operator / cashier" as Op
participant "Central PMS context" as Central
participant "Operator Console /\napproved governance" as OC
participant "Supervisor" as Sup
participant "Audit / Reconciliation" as Audit
participant "Gate / physical release boundary" as Gate

Op -> OC : request manual release review
OC -> Central : retrieve payment/fiscal/exit/incident context
OC -> Sup : supervisor review where policy requires
alt approved
  Sup --> OC : approval + reason
  OC -> Audit : incident/audit/reconciliation tags
  OC --> Gate : physical release boundary only if separately approved
else rejected / pending
  OC -> Audit : rejection or pending review
end

note bottom
Manual release is governed exception.
It is not normal ExitAuthorization and does not close reconciliation by itself.
end note
@enduml
